description	"The Mandalorian Mercenary

Based on open mode's Mandalorian class, carries a pair of overcharged blaster pistols, an enhanced flamethrower, and a mandalorian wrist blaster.

^2Weaponry:
- Overcharged Westar Pistols (4)
- Jetpack Rocket ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
- Flamethrower ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- 20% Less Damage Output
- Fuel (3)
- CTF: 32s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack

^2Strengths^7: Well armored, Mobile, effective at a wide variety of ranges, and formidable against Jedi.
^7No specific Weaknesses."